<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Ablation results on varying <math id="S4.F4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> for class unlearning of MNIST, CIFAR-10, and tinyImageNet.</figcaption>
